OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud across the region with the odd
OL,7,Fshower initially.Becoming overcast
OL,8,Ffrom the south with more widespread
OL,9,Flight rain for a time overnight.
OL,10,FTurning chilly in clear spells
OL,11,Ffollowing the rain, but remaining
OL,12,Ffrost free. Breezy, particularly
OL,13,Faround the coast.
OL,14,
OL,15,CWednesday:FRemaining mostly cloudy
OL,16,Fwith isolated showers but also some
OL,17,Fbright spells possible. Brisk easterly
OL,18,Fwinds, with temperatures remaining
OL,19,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
