OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,7,Fbringing cloudy conditions with a few
OL,8,Fshowers, and a brisk easterly breeze
OL,9,Fat times. Temperatures remain around
OL,10,Fnormal for the time of year.
